#!/bin/sh
# Every main screen of Dogear, in a dark and a light Omarchy theme, one PNG
# per board of the design canvas: bin/shots [prefix] [extra bin/shot options].
# Compare build/shots/<prefix>-*.png against the canvas after each change.
set -eu

ROOT="$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")/.." && pwd)"
prefix="${1:-now}"; [ $# -gt 0 ] && shift
SHOT="$ROOT/bin/shot"

# A novel from the seeded library, opened in the reader.
BOOK="library.allBooks().find(b => /Ann Veronica/.test(b.title)) || library.allBooks()[0]"
OPEN="win.openBook(($BOOK).id)"
# Past the cover and front matter, to a page of text.
TEXT="readerLoader.item.goTo({chapter: 6, instant: true})"
R="readerLoader.item"

failed=0
export DOGEAR_SHOT_QUIET=1
command -v xvfb-run >/dev/null 2>&1 || echo "bin/shots: no xvfb-run, so book pages render blank (install xorg-server-xvfb)" >&2
shoot() {
    name="$1"; shift
    "$SHOT" "$prefix-$name" "$@" >/dev/null || { echo "FAILED: $prefix-$name (see build/shots/$prefix-$name.log)" >&2; failed=1; }
}

for mode in dark light; do
    if [ "$mode" = dark ]; then theme="tokyo-night"; else theme="catppuccin-latte"; fi
    t="--theme $theme"
    shoot "library-$mode" $t "$@"
    shoot "empty-$mode" $t --empty "$@"
    shoot "welcome-$mode" $t --empty --first-run "$@"
    shoot "palette-$mode" $t "$@" -- --run "commandPalette.show()"
    shoot "settings-$mode" $t "$@" -- --run "win.showAiSettings()"
    shoot "settings-general-$mode" $t "$@" -- --run "settingsView.show('general')"
    shoot "reader-$mode" $t "$@" -- --delay 2500 --step 2500 --run "$OPEN" --run "$TEXT" --run "$R.showChrome()"
    shoot "companion-$mode" $t "$@" -- --delay 2500 --step 2500 --run "$OPEN" --run "$TEXT" --run "$R.showCompanion('ask')"
    shoot "narrator-$mode" $t "$@" -- --delay 2500 --step 2500 --run "$OPEN" --run "$TEXT" --run "$R.showVoices()"
    shoot "appearance-$mode" $t "$@" -- --delay 2500 --step 2500 --run "$OPEN" --run "$TEXT" --run "$R.showAppearance()"
    shoot "help-$mode" $t "$@" -- --run "win.helpVisible = true"
done
ls "$ROOT/build/shots/$prefix"-*.png
exit "$failed"
